@startuml
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class CancerStage {
  cancerConditionAtDiagnosisReference : Reference(CancerConditionAtDiagnosis) [1..1]
  classificationType : codeableConcept [0..1]
  value : CancerStageComponent [1..*]
  type : codeableConcept [1..1]
  evidenceReference : Reference(Surgery,Imaging) [0..*]  
}

note left of CancerStage::classificationType
Staging classification system (e.g. TNM).
Required for TNM.
Optional for single-value staging systems.
end note
note left of CancerStage::value
One or more staging components
expressed as (code, value) pairs.
- Single-value systems: 1 component
- TNM: 3 components (T, N, M)
end note
note left of CancerStage::type
Choice: Clinical | Pathological
end note
@enduml
